{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\ndef solve(n, mod):\n    if n <= 3:\n        return 0\n    last_ans = 17\n    ans = 17\n    size = (n-1)*(n-2)//2 + 1\n    record = [[0]*(size+1) for _ in range(2)]\n    record[0][:4] = [1,2,2,1]\n    inv = 0\n    for m in range(4, n):\n        tp_size = m*(m-1)//2\n        ans = (m+1) * last_ans\n        cur = inv ^ 1\n        nxt = inv\n        for i in range(m):\n            record[nxt][i] = (sum(record[cur][:i+1]) if i>0 else record[cur][0]) % mod\n        for i in range(m, tp_size//2 + 1):\n            record[nxt][i] = (sum(record[cur][i-m+1:i+1])) % mod\n        for i in range(tp_size//2 + 1):\n            record[nxt][tp_size - i] = record[nxt][i]\n        total = 0\n        for i in range(tp_size - 1):\n            inner_sum = 0\n            for j in range(max(1, -tp_size + i + m + 2), m+1):\n                inner_sum += j * int(record[nxt][m+2-j+i])\n            total += int(record[nxt][i])\n            total %= mod\n            ans += (inner_sum * total) % mod\n            ans %= mod\n        last_ans = ans\n        inv ^= 1\n    return int(ans) % mod\n\ndef main():\n    n, mod = map(int, input().split())\n    print(solve(n, mod))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static long solve(int n, long mod) {\n        if (n <= 3) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        long lastAns = 17;\n        long ans = 17;\n        int size = (n - 1) * (n - 2) / 2 + 1;\n        long[][] record = new long[2][size + 1];\n        record[0][0] = 1;\n        record[0][1] = 2;\n        record[0][2] = 2;\n        record[0][3] = 1;\n        int inv = 0;\n        for (int m = 4; m < n; m++) {\n            int tpSize = m * (m - 1) / 2;\n            ans = (m + 1) * lastAns % mod;\n            int cur = inv ^ 1;\n            int nxt = inv;\n            // first loop: i from 0 to m-1\n            for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n                long sum = 0;\n                if (i > 0) {\n                    for (int k = 0; k <= i; k++) {\n                        sum += record[cur][k];\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    sum = record[cur][0];\n                }\n                record[nxt][i] = sum % mod;\n            }\n            // second loop: i from m to tpSize/2\n            int half = tpSize / 2;\n            for (int i = m; i <= half; i++) {\n                long sum = 0;\n                int start = i - m + 1;\n                for (int k = start; k <= i; k++) {\n                    sum += record[cur][k];\n                }\n                record[nxt][i] = sum % mod;\n            }\n            // mirror\n            for (int i = 0; i <= half; i++) {\n                record[nxt][tpSize - i] = record[nxt][i];\n            }\n            long total = 0;\n            for (int i = 0; i < tpSize - 1; i++) {\n                long innerSum = 0;\n                int low = Math.max(1, -tpSize + i + m + 2);\n                for (int j = low; j <= m; j++) {\n                    innerSum = (innerSum + j * record[nxt][m + 2 - j + i]) % mod;\n                }\n                total = (total + record[nxt][i]) % mod;\n                ans = (ans + innerSum * total) % mod;\n            }\n            lastAns = ans;\n            inv ^= 1;\n        }\n        return ans % mod;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        long mod = sc.nextLong();\n        System.out.println(solve(n, mod));\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.3589766240329482e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -2.4318398573086597e-05, -4.95898348162882e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.8371408916427754e-05, -0.0041166334412992, -0.0004351384413894266, -3.099436753473128e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.09102912992238998, -0.0015051951631903648, -0.000263894529780373, -0.031633410602808, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.3132704496383667, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.018150312826037407, 0.0, 0.0, -0.005234109237790108, -4.768360213347478e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, -5.006777428206988e-06, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.753696753643453e-05, -0.10020788013935089, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.25198426842689514, 0.0, -0.00012385078298393637, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -4.851700214203447e-05, -0.0009148702956736088, -0.5760384202003479, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0003761537664104253, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -7.152531907195225e-06, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.0035129995085299015, -1.311301275563892e-06, 0.0, -0.0007099968497641385, -1.3589766240329482e-05, -0.16022562980651855, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576